config IQS9150
	tristate "IQS9150 Driver"
	depends on I2C
	help
		Enable support for the IQS9150 capacitive touchscreen controller
		from Azoteq. The driver communicates over I2C and reports
		multi-touch events via the Linux input subsystem.

		To compile this driver as a loadable module, choose M here;
		the module will be called iqs9150.
